msgstr "&Inladen binnen den Hööftdeel vun de Naricht loosstüern"

#. i18n: ectx: property (toolTip), widget (QCheckBox, mExchangeCompatibleInvitations)
#. +> trunk
#: invitationsettings.ui:45
msgid ""
"Microsoft Outlook, when used in combination with a Microsoft Exchange server,\n"
"has a problem understanding standards-compliant groupware email.\n"
"Turn this option on to send groupware invitations in a way that Microsoft Exchange understands."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft Outlook hett, wenn dat tosamen mit en Microsoft Exchange Server bruukt warrt,\n"
"Problemen bi't Verstahn vun Arbeitkoppel-Nettpost, de langs den Standard opstellt wöör.\n"
"Maak dit an, wenn ok MS Exchange Dien Arbeitkoppel-Inladen verstahn könen schall."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, mExchangeCompatibleInvitations)
#. +> trunk
#: invitationsettings.ui:48
msgid "Exchange-compatible invitation &naming"
msgstr "Inladen kompatibel to MS Exchange &nömen"

