#. +> trunk
#: invitationsettings.ui:55
msgid "Send invitation reply comments in a way that Microsoft Outlook(tm) understands."
msgstr "Inladen-Anterkommentar so loosstüern, dat ok Microsoft Outlook(tm) se versteiht."

